UniADet sample-result panels

The input photographs and ground-truth masks in 0.png, 1.png and 2.png are derived
from the Visual Anomaly (VisA) dataset by Yang Zou, Jongheon Jeong, Latha
Pemula, Dongqing Zhang, and Onkar Dabeer (2022).

Source: https://github.com/amazon-science/spot-diff
Dataset license: https://github.com/amazon-science/spot-diff/blob/main/LICENSE-DATASET
License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Changes: resized photographs and masks, added independently computed UniADet
anomaly-map overlays and labels. These composite panels are
distributed under CC BY 4.0, not anomalib's source-code Apache-2.0 license.

Corrected-recipe provenance: results/UniADet/sample_images.json
